.TH SPAN 1
.SH NAME
span \- bridge builder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/span
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Span
is a bridge builder.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Place masses and members (m/c/s/w), then space to run the simulation. Keys v and d select move and delete; n starts a new bridge.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B m
Mass mode
.TP
.B c
Concrete mode
.TP
.B s
Steel mode
.TP
.B w
Wire mode
.TP
.B v
Move mode
.TP
.B d
Delete mode
.TP
.B LMB
Place/edit per mode
.TP
.B RMB
Cycle mode
.TP
.B space
Run/stop simulation
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B n
New bridge
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/span.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR ode (2),
.IR wm (1)
